 ],
 "synopsis": "Pride Hotels Group CEO and whole-time director Satyen Jain discussed the hotel chain's growth strategy ahead of a planned initial public offering. The company has set aside Rs 160 crore from the IPO proceeds for upgrades and renovations, as it plans to expand its portfolio from 40 to 72 properties. Jain noted that India must boost global tourism marketing to drive industry growth, and addressed challenges including high land and construction costs that drive up room rates.",
